         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Sport games outdoors concept. Two athletic young men playing basketball in urban stadium. Guys training on outdoor court with fence in background. Can be used for match, sport activity concepts</rdf:li>
